# novadeck: enable the volume/brightness media-key agent on release. Same rationale as
# 60-novadeck-powerbuttond.preset — /etc/machine-id is empty on a fresh image so systemd runs preset-all on
# first boot where the stock 99-default.preset is "disable *"; this higher-priority preset (60 < 99)
# keeps the agent enabled. A build-time multi-user.target.wants symlink ships alongside as a fallback.
enable novadeck-hotkeyd.service
